            </note>
            <note corresp="#d373-f3" n="3" xml:id="d373-f3-content">
                <p>McGeorge Bundy wrote “OK” in the margin next to this sentence.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d373-f4" n="4" xml:id="d373-f4-content">
                <p>William Bundy, Assistant Secretary of State for Far Eastern Affairs.</p>
            </note>
